# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in what you need.
# `.env.local` is gitignored, so your values never get committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Site URL (recommended before deploying)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The canonical origin of the live site, no trailing slash. Used for canonical
# tags, Open Graph image URLs and the sitemap.
#
# This already defaults to https://jessicamiranda.dev (the domain on your
# LinkedIn), so a deploy is correct without setting anything. Only uncomment
# the line below if you deploy somewhere else.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://yourdomain.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form endpoint (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the contact form POSTs its JSON payload:
#   { name, email, subject, message }
#
# If this is left unset (or removed), the form still validates and then hands
# the message to the visitor's mail client instead, and says so on screen.
# Nothing is ever reported as "sent" when it wasn't.
#
# Any of these work — just paste the URL they give you:
#   Formspree   https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Web3Forms   https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#   Your own    https://your-api.example.com/contact
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
